WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,260 --> 00:00:02,340
captain beauty

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:03,860
can you be nicer to me

3
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:05,500
I have had no father or mother since I was a child

4
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,380
Grew up with Grandma Duhu

5
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,740
Not a single friend

6
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:10,380
Now it’s the end of the world

7
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:11,580
I really want to be with you

8
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:13,260
Become comrades in life, death and merit

9
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,140
Can you accept me like this?

10
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:16,300
speak human language

11
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:17,620
I want some supplies

12
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:20,860
I don’t feel safe without supplies.

13
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:23,010
You should move the supplies in the car now.

14
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:25,210
Tomorrow I'll give you one-third of the rest.

15
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:27,210
Captain Beauty is simply an angel in heaven

16
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:28,210
Beautiful people and kind hearts

17
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:29,810
I will definitely follow you and work hard from now on

18
00:00:30,490 --> 00:00:33,770
superb acting skills

19
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:35,690
Not giving Shidashi the benefit

20
00:00:35,690 --> 00:00:43,720
I can't seduce him at all.

21
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:44,880
Give him whatever he wants
